# Black Acropolis

id:world-black-acropolis a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Black Acropolis" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/48000db9a9c2f> ;
    oa:editorialNote "---- Solsys Organization -------------------------------------------------\n\nThe nearest roster in the file: three systems inside 11 ly. Sol itself is\nalready here as Earth." ;
    oa:kind "megastructure" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "A dyson swarm of xenosophont origin, in Ophiuchus at 1,530 ly — near the Serpens Reach without being of it: 124 ly from the Sparks, 268 from Vinculum, 312 from Miracle City. Nobody terragen built it, so the affiliation records what made it rather than who holds it." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

